   <tr>\n      <td class=\"cn\">能源危机，水资源匮乏，森林减少</td>\n      <td class=\"en\">Energy crisis, water shortage, deforestation</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"cn\">自然灾害、酸雨、沙尘暴、干旱、水灾</td>\n      <td class=\"en\">Natural disasters, acid rain, sand storms, drought, flood</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr><td class=\"section\" colspan=\"2\">所有这些问题的根本原因</td></tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"cn\">人口增长，工业发展，长期的人类活动</td>\n      <td class=\"en\">Population growth, industrial development, long-term human activities</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr><td class=\"section\" colspan=\"2\">正确的解决方法</td></tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"cn\">世界方面：全球合作，达成共识，制定环境保护的国际标准</td>\n      <td class=\"en\">Global cooperation, reach the agreement, set international standards for environmental preserve</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"cn\">政府方面：制定环保政策，鼓励低碳经济</td>\n      <td class=\"en\">Make laws, encourage low carbon economy</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"cn\">科技方面：大力开发可再生的、清洁的新能源，投资研发节能科技</td>\n      <td class=\"en\">Exploit renewable, green energy, invest in energy-saving technologies</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"cn\">公司方面：推出环保产品，引领大众绿色消费习惯</td>\n      <td class=\"en\">Promote environmental-friendly products, lead green consuming habits</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"cn\">个人方面：提升环保意识，倡导低碳生活方式</td>\n      <td class=\"en\">raise public's green awareness, encourage low carbon lifestyle</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <div class=\"vocab-head\">核心词汇及短语：</div>\n  <div class=\"vocab\">\n    low carbon 低碳<span class=\"gap\"></span>green adj. 环保的<span class=\"gap\"></span>environmental-friendly adj. 环保的<span class=\"gap\"></span>eco-friendly adj. 环保的<span class=\"gap\"></span>ecosystem n. 生态系统<span class=\"gap\"></span>environmental protection 环境保护<span class=\"gap\"></span>preserve vt. 保护<span class=\"gap\"></span>sustainable development 可持续发展<span class=\"gap\"></span>deplete natural resources 耗尽自然资源<span class=\"gap\"></span>leave a carbon footprint 留下